	"title"		"HeartShake (尖塔之心心跳震动 / Corrupt Heart Heartbeat)"
	"description"		"[h1]HeartShake(尖塔之心心跳震动)[/h1]

在 Act4Heart mod 的尖塔之心(Corrupt Heart)战斗中, 还原一代原版的心跳: 每 1.33 秒一次的屏幕脉冲震动 + 一代原版心跳音效, 直到心脏被打死.

[i]Restores the Slay the Spire 1 heartbeat in the Act4Heart mod's Corrupt Heart fight: a screen pulse with the original StS1 heartbeat sound every 1.33 seconds, until the heart dies.[/i]

[hr]

[h2]还原细节 / Fidelity[/h2]

参数直接从一代原版 jar 反编译提取, 不是凭印象仿制:
[list]
[*]节拍: 一代心脏 idle 动画 2.0 秒 * 1.5 倍速 = 每 1.3333 秒一拍, 恒定不加速
[*]震动: 一代的 LOW / SHORT 档 (对应二代 Weak / Short), 尊重游戏内屏幕震动强度设置
[*]音效: 一代原版 SLS_SFX_HeartBeat_Simple, 音量 0.75, 随机音高抖动 -0.05 ~ +0.05
[*]心跳只在心脏存活期间跳动, 击杀瞬间停止
[/list]

[i]All parameters extracted from the original StS1 jar bytecode: constant 1.3333s interval, LOW/SHORT-equivalent shake (respects your screen shake setting), the original heartbeat ogg at volume 0.75 with pitch jitter, stops the moment the heart dies.[/i]

[h2]使用方法 / Usage[/h2]

[list]
[*][b]必须先订阅[/b][url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3747537811]Act 4 Heart[/url](工坊 3747537811)
[*]进入 Act4 的尖塔之心战斗即自动生效, 无需任何操作
[*]设置 -> Mod 设置 -> HeartShake 可关闭震动或单独关闭音效
[/list]

[i]Requires the Act 4 Heart mod (linked above). Works automatically in the Corrupt Heart fight. Toggle shake or sound separately in Settings -> Mod Settings -> HeartShake.[/i]

[hr]

[h2]前置依赖 / Requirements[/h2]

[list]
[*][b]必须[/b]:[url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3747537811]Act 4 Heart[/url]
[*][b]必须[/b]:[url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3737335127]BaseLib[/url]
[/list]

[b]重要 - BaseLib 版本提示 / Important - BaseLib version note[/b]

创意工坊的 BaseLib 更新经常落后于官方 GitHub.游戏版本更新后,如果工坊版 BaseLib 报错或本 mod 无法加载,请前往 GitHub 下载最新版:
[list]
[*][url=https://github.com/Alchyr/BaseLib-StS2/releases]GitHub Releases(推荐 / recommended)[/url] - 最新正式版
[*]安装方法:下载 zip,解压到 [code]Slay the Spire 2/mods/[/code],并[b]取消订阅工坊版 BaseLib[/b](避免双加载)
[/list]

[i]The Workshop BaseLib often lags behind the official GitHub. If BaseLib errors after a game update, grab the latest release from GitHub (link above), unzip into the mods folder, and unsubscribe from the Workshop copy to avoid double-loading.[/i]"
	"changenote"		"Initial release: StS1 heartbeat (1.3333s interval, Weak/Short shake, original ogg at 0.75 vol with pitch jitter) in the Act4Heart Corrupt Heart fight."
}
